Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Yeah, it's so funny, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}because me and Drake, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}いや、マジで笑えるんだけどさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺とDrakeがさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:06.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}before Donda came out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:06.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}we met up at the studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:06.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}『Donda』が出る前に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:06.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}スタジオで会ったんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:10.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So then Drake says to me, yo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:10.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}で、Drakeが俺に言うわけ…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}no, I need to tell the story like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}いや、話す順番を変えるわ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So basically, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}Jared Kushner asked Steve Stoute,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}要するにさ、Jared Kushnerが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}Steve Stouteに聞いたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.73,0:00:24.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}like, yo, just tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.73,0:00:24.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}did Ye f**k my wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.73,0:00:24.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「正直に言ってくれ、Yeは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.73,0:00:24.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}俺の妻とヤったのか？」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:27.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And Steve Stoute was like, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:27.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}Steveは「いや、Yeは何もしてない」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.39,0:00:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Ye never did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.39,0:00:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}Steveは「いや、Yeは何もしてない」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:31.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}So when I went to the White House,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:31.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}で、White Houseに行った時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I saw Jared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}Jaredに会ったんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I was like, yo, I want to just tell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you, nothing ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}俺は「一応言っとくけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}ど、何もなかったから」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.37,0:00:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}He's like, yo, I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.37,0:00:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.37,0:00:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}あいつは「何の話かわからない」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:40.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I was like, yo, and I grabbed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:40.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}him by both shoulders,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.29,0:00:40.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}で、俺はあいつの両肩をつかんで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:41.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}and I was like, yo, Jared,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:41.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}「Jared、マジで何もなかったから」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:44.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}nothing has ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:44.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}「Jared、マジで何もなかったから」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:46.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And he said, yo, thank
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:46.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}you for saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.51,0:00:46.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}そしたら「言ってくれてありがとう」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.91,0:00:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}Okay, so when I saw Drake,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.91,0:00:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}we was in a parking lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.91,0:00:50.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}で、Drakeに会った時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.37,0:00:51.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}we were talking, and he said, yo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.37,0:00:51.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}駐車場で話してたら、あいつが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.83,0:00:54.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I just want to tell you, yo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.83,0:00:54.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}nothing ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.83,0:00:54.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}「一応言っとくけど、
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.83,0:00:54.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1098)\fs50}何もなかったから」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}And then I said, yo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs54}thank you for saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:58.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}で、俺が「言ってくれてありがとう」って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}When did I become Jared Kushner?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}いつから俺が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1048)\fs50}Jared Kushnerになったんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:06.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I didn't know where this was going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:06.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}どこに向かう話かと思ったわ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.81,0:01:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}I did not know where this was going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.81,0:01:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}マジでどうなるかと思った
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:14.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,948)\fs54}You had me scared for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:14.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,998)\fs50}一瞬ビビったわ
